<title>ITALY: Italian petroleum use down 7.1 pct in Jan--UP.</title>
<headline>Italian petroleum use down 7.1 pct in Jan--UP.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian consumption of petroleum products fell 7.1 percent to 7.8 million tonnes in January, compared with the same month in 1996, according to data from trade group Unione Petrolifera released on Thursday.</p>
<p>Consumption of petrol fell 1.3 percent to 1.3 million tonnes, while fuel oil use slipped 18 percent to 2.09 million tonnes, it added.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
